49:52Z","value":28,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5065330","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1846651706690516","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Cleaner Company launches 28 January 2027 and joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"CLEANER COMPANY IS LAUNCHING ON 28 JANUARY 2027! 🎉 We're excited to announce that Cleaner Company will launch on 28 January 2027! We can't wait for you to grab your gear, gather your crew and enjoy the full game together! CLEANER COMPANY IS TAKING PART IN STEAM NEXT FEST! Steam Next Fest is here, and Cleaner Company is joining the festival! If you've been meaning to check out our Demo, now is the perfect time to jump in, grab your cleaning gear, and get to work! But that's not all. We've prepare","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:28:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1845383656392996","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"update","title":"Galactic Cleanup Demo Hotfix #4","summary":"Hey Cleaners, We’ve got another update for you! This patch focuses on improving performance, stability, and giving you a little more control over how you run the game. Here’s what this update brings: Added the option to choose between DX11 and DX12 - DX11 can be a better choice for players with older or lower-end hardwareFixed an issue that could cause the game to freeze at random momentsGeneral stability improvementsPerformance improvements across the gameAs always, your reports and feedback he","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:41:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1844115010494405","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"update","title":"Galactic Cleanup Demo Hotfix #3","summary":"Hey Cleaners, Today’s patch brings an important improvement to how you invite friends through the Steam friends list. We’ve added a fix that makes sending and accepting invites more reliable, and far less prone to failing at random moments. Here’s what this update includes:Steam friend‑list invite fixBetter handling of failed inviteThe Cleaner Company Crew ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T10:44:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1844115010492205","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"update","title":"Galactic Cleanup Demo Hotfix #2","summary":"Hey Cleaners,Today’s patch focuses on the connection issues some of you were running into when trying to join another player’s game. We really zeroed in on this problem -- you know we move fast when something blocks multiplayer!Here’s what this update tackles:Improved session stabilityFixes for joining friend sessionsBetter error handling when connections failAdditional improvements for joining games through the session browserYour crash logs and reports helped us massively thanks for taking the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T14:23:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1844115010489271","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"update","title":"Galactic Cleanup Demo Hotfix #1","summary":"Hey Cleaners, Our first hotfix for Cleaner Company Demo just went live! This update includes several important fixes for issues you’ve reported, and we’re also adding a new crash log reporter to help us track down problems faster and more accurately. Here’s what’s in the hotfix:Crash Log Reporter supportNumerous gamepad fixesFind Session filter bug fixesUI/UX navigation improvementsNumerous optimization improvements Thanks for being here and helping us make Cleaner Company better every day! The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T14:23:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489271","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1843481262704731","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"update","title":"A quick update from the Cleaner Company Crew","summary":"Hey everyone, We wanted to firstly say a big thank you to everyone who has jumped into the Cleaner Company Demo so far since launch, it's great to see so many of you jump in to help clean up the Galaxy! We’ve been keeping a close eye on your feedback, reports and discussions and we’re aware that some folks are running into bugs and other issues while playing the demo. Our team is currently investigating the reported issues and working on fixes to make the demo as smooth and enjoyable as possible","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T14:22:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704731","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1843481262701658","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Cleaner Company Demo - AVAILABLE NOW!","summary":"THE CLEANER COMPANY DEMO IS LIVE! 🫧The wait is over, we are pleased to announce that the Cleaner Company’s demo is making its debut at Steam’s Party‑Based RPG Fest, and you can jump in and play it RIGHT NOW! We’ve been working hard behind the scenes, fixing, polishing, and adding new content, and today you can finally jump in and get your hands dirty solo or with friends. Watch our brand new Demo trailer below WHAT IS IN THE DEMO?The Demo brings a brand new map for you to clean and explore The F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:17:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701658","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1841579228677725","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Cleaner Company Demo debuts on 14 September!","summary":"Cleaner Company Demo Lands at Party‑Based RPG Fest! We’re thrilled to announce that the Cleaner Company Demo will officially debut on 14 September as part of Party‑Based RPG Fest on Steam! 🪠 What’s Waiting for You Inside?This special demo brings a brand‑new map packed with fresh features, new monsters, multiple fixes and plenty of chaotic moments for you to discover. It’s your chance to jump in early, experiment with the updated systems, and help us shape the next stage of the game! We’re incred","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T09:00:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1837955055366016","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Cleaner Company Playtest has officially wrapped up - thank you, Cleaners!","summary":"Today, the playtests officially come to an end, and we want to say one thing: thank you. ❤️Your excitement, creativity, and dedication blew us away. Together with Mythwright, we’re absolutely thrilled to see such a huge community eager to help shape this game with us. Your feedback has been incredibly positive, and the surveys you sent gave us a clear signal: we’re heading in the right direction. Thank you for every minute spent in the game, every suggestion, every bug report, and every chaotic ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T12:42:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1836506165549219","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Cleaner Company Playtest is available now!","summary":"Get ready, Cleaners - the very first Cleaner Company Playtest is officially LIVE! The doors to interstellar janitorial glory have just swung open, and you can jump in right now. The playtest runs until 9 July, giving you plenty of time to scrub, sweep, salvage… and survive.This first-ever hands‑on look at the game lets you experience Cleaner Company in both singleplayer and co‑op, across two distinct locations filled with grime, hazards, and the occasional \"what on earth is that\" moment.You’ll g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T13:00:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165549219","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1828894815556683","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 Wishlists! Thank you! 🔥","summary":"Hello Cleaners! We’ve just passed an amazing milestone - 100,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉 Thank you all so much for the incredible support. It means a lot to see so many of you excited about the game! Together with Mythwright, we’re working as hard as we can to deliver the best possible game for you. More updates (and more messes to clean) are coming soon! 🔥","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T07:49:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815556683","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1827626365750522","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"A Big Cleanup Is Coming - Announcing Our Publisher!","summary":"Hello Cleaners! Today we’re sweeping in with some very exciting news. After months of mopping, polishing, and scrubbing every corner of the project, we’re excited to officially announce our partnership with Mythwright! Together, we’re gearing up to bring the game to a whole new level; more shine, more polish, and a lot more power behind the scenes. With their support, we can focus even more on what we do best: making the most horrifying messes fun to clean up.. What This Means for the GameExtra ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-18T15:01:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365750522","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1824459501606578","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Signups Open Now!","summary":"Get ready, Cleaners - the very first Cleaner Company Playtest is on the way! This upcoming playtest will let you jump straight into the chaos of interstellar janitorial work: cleaning, fixing, compacting… and occasionally dealing with things that definitely weren’t in the job description. You’ll get hands‑on experience with our core gameplay loop: mop, vacuum and tidy up hazardous zones,keep your team in one piece (or… compact them if things go wrong),restore order to messy corners of the galaxy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-12T11:53:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824459501606578","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1800991756447334","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"#2 Devlog: Death system, new wiping system, rotating objects","summary":"Hello galactic wipers!🧹 What's New: 🧼 New mop cleaning system – cleaning now feels smoother and more satisfying! 🔄 Item rotation – you can now freely rotate objects in the environment. 💀 Player death & respawn system – yes, you can die now... but don’t worry, you’ll come back! 👻We've improved ragdoll physics and added cloth physics for a more immersive experience. We're currently working on a character progression system, an in-game shop where you'll be able to spend your mission-earned cash on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-02T17:53:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800991756447334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3644020-1799817379638647","game_id":"steam-3644020","kind":"announcement","title":"#1 Devlog: New body system physics + Thank You for 20.000 wishlists!","summary":"CLEANER COMPANY DEVLOG #1 Hey Star Wipers! 🧹 First of all — a huge THANK YOU to everyone who has added Cleaner Company to their wishlist. We've officially hit 20,000 wishlists and we’re incredibly grateful for the amazing support from our community. Your enthusiasm truly motivates us to keep pushing the game forward. 🙏❤️ What’s New? We’ve been hard at work improving and expanding the game. In this devlog, we’re excited to share two big updates: 🗺️ New Map Reveal We’re introducing a brand new map","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-20T20:06:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799817379638647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3644020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3644020":"2026-10-26T10:40:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3644020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:41Z"},"5065330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:42Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3644020","app_id":3644020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1ee719eb78400246f319c8ea763119f1b0814829bdd56206a7c79708c9141b8f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"스타 와이퍼즈, 대걸레 준비! Cleaner Company는 유혈이 낭자한 1~4인 청소 시뮬레이션 게임입니다. 은하계 곳곳의 버려진 우주 정거장, 외계 전초 기지, 해충이 들끓는 레스토랑을 청소하세요... 먼저 전임자들의 시체부터 치워야 합니다. ","publishers":[{"name":"Mythwright","creator_clan_account_id":44992016}],"developers":[{"name":"Wildflame Studio"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801159200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"(EN) Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792414676","trailer_category":1,"microt